<title>USA: Ivory Coast seeks up to 29,000 T U.S. rice.</title>
<headline>Ivory Coast seeks up to 29,000 T U.S. rice.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivory Coast will seek up to 29,000 tonnes U.S. long grain brown rice under PL-480, Title I, for the October 15-November 15 and/or November 15-December 15 shipment periods, its U.S. export agent said.</p>
<p>Bids are due by September 11 and remain valid until September 12.</p>
<p>The rice is to be U.S. grade No. 2 or better with maximum four percent broken kernels.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
